## 1. Objective

This document formalizes the transformation of ambiguous semantic intent ($\text{human}_1$) into deterministic machine execution ($\text{math}_1$) using a **Cryptographic Spatiotemporal Origin Anchor**.

The goal is to prove that any fuzzy or natural language query $Q$ can be deterministically bound to a unique origin point in spacetime, evaluated locally with sub-3ms latency, and routed to an exact SDK action without relying on cloud-based LLM judgment layers.

