## 6. Verification Test Case (Python Reference)

```python
import hashlib
import time
import uuid

def generate_origin_seed(lat: float, lon: float) -> str:
    uuid_str = str(uuid.uuid4())
    utc_time = time.time_ns()
    raw_payload = f"{uuid_str}:{utc_time}:{lat},{lon}"
    return hashlib.sha256(raw_payload.encode('utf-8')).hexdigest()

